{"id":"n86479-3-7","stage":4,"title":"헐다 · 破开","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n86479-3-7-1","ko":"어쩌지. 잔돈이 없네.","zh":"怎么办啊，我没零钱了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어쩌지.","meaning":"“어찌하다(怎么会)”的缩略语。","explanation":"어쩌다：“어찌하다(怎么会)”的缩略语。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"어쩌다","audio":"/audio/85a8c2b5d5fccc03afbb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91975","senseId":"1","lemma":"어쩌다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어쩌지","audio":"/audio/e458e74417e5e016790e.mp3"}},{"text":"잔돈이","meaning":"零钱","explanation":"잔돈：零钱；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"잔돈","audio":"/audio/0d92cfbd94c1166956c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"76131","senseId":"1","lemma":"잔돈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잔돈이","audio":"/audio/39554ed712d248bea0ab.mp3"}},{"text":"없네.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없네","audio":"/audio/40299a69ec2e93a5e2b3.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"85a8c2b5d5fccc03","term":"어쩌다","zh":"“어찌하다(怎么会)”的缩略语。","audio":"/audio/85a8c2b5d5fccc03afbb.mp3","entryId":"91975","definition":"“어찌하다(怎么会)”的缩略语。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"0d92cfbd94c11669","term":"잔돈","zh":"零钱","audio":"/audio/0d92cfbd94c1166956c3.mp3","entryId":"76131","definition":"面值小的钱。","pronunciation":["잔돈"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人或事物等实际上不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/7305a342a48532801886.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n86479-3-7-2","ko":"편의점에서 물건을 사고 지폐를 헐어 와.","zh":"去便利店买点东西，把纸币换零钱回来。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"편의점에서","meaning":"便利店，超市","explanation":"편의점：便利店，超市；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"편의점","audio":"/audio/590f2a3e6ebd654080a3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82055","senseId":"1","lemma":"편의점","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"편의점에서","audio":"/audio/c09438bb87f99b71d1bb.mp3"}},{"text":"물건을","meaning":"商品，物品","explanation":"물건：商品，物品；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"물건","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66247","senseId":"4","lemma":"물건","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"물건을","audio":"/audio/9f0ff175ca9f394f7144.mp3"}},{"text":"사고","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사고","audio":"/audio/2b04ea5b795422b77c61.mp3"}},{"text":"지폐를","meaning":"纸币","explanation":"지폐：纸币；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"지폐","audio":"/audio/36693e4ef44156245eab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28946","senseId":"1","lemma":"지폐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지폐를","audio":"/audio/a8e0f247c3af51fbe420.mp3"}},{"text":"헐어","meaning":"破开","explanation":"헐다：破开；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"헐다","audio":"/audio/b600a3d1a4a1fb6e6313.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86479","senseId":"3","lemma":"헐다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"헐어","audio":"/audio/56f5fbe8f53aa3bf336f.mp3"}},{"text":"와.","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"와","audio":"/audio/d536e6255a4151eae226.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"590f2a3e6ebd6540","term":"편의점","zh":"便利店，超市","audio":"/audio/590f2a3e6ebd654080a3.mp3","entryId":"82055","definition":"每天24小时营业，销售简单的生活必需品的店铺。","pronunciation":["펴늬점","펴니점"]},{"id":"d